# PRIVATE-DATA WARNING
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The NyayOS project references a founder-controlled private criminal matter
# (the "Foodgod FPO matter"). That matter is PRIVATE EVALUATION ONLY.
#
# NEVER commit to this repository:
#   - any file from the private matter (FIR, complaints, bail papers,
#     chargesheets, court orders, correspondence, chat exports, media);
#   - any document containing party names, addresses, phone numbers,
#     Aadhaar/PAN/passport numbers, case numbers, CNR numbers or FIR numbers;
#   - any real user, client or pilot-participant case material;
#   - credentials, tokens, API keys, service-account files or .env files.
#
# Governance references to the matter (e.g. "this matter is private, do not
# train on it") are policy statements and are permitted. Case CONTENT is not.
#
# If you are unsure whether a file is case content, DO NOT COMMIT IT.
# ==========================================================================

